# ML Monitoring System Rules

## ML System Architecture
- **Multi-interface intelligence**: Support Starlink, Cellular, WiFi, and LAN interfaces
- **Cost-aware monitoring**: Use MWAN3 pings for cellular (zero data cost), 1-second monitoring for Starlink
- **Real-time analytics**: Track prediction accuracy, interface scores, and ML impact
- **Ensemble methods**: Use k-NN, Neural Networks, and sliding window predictors

## ML Data Collection
- **Real data integration**: Use actual Starlink, GPS, and weather data (no simulation)
- **Historical matching**: Correlate obstruction and satellite visibility data
- **Sky grid mapping**: 90x45 sky grid with exponential learning
- **Performance tracking**: 60-minute trends with linear regression

## Analytics and Visualization
- **ML Analytics Engine**: Track prediction accuracy, scoring, and impact measurement
- **Web Dashboard**: Real-time charts and interface monitoring
- **Command-line Tool**: Full-featured CLI for system administration
- **UBUS API**: 20+ methods for complete system control

## Interface Scoring System
- **Score range**: 0-100 with color-coded health (Excellent/Good/Fair/Poor/Very Poor)
- **Contributors**: Track latency, signal strength, predictions, and stability
- **Trend analysis**: Identify improving/declining performance patterns
- **Real-time updates**: Continuous monitoring with background validation

## ML Performance Metrics
- **Accuracy tracking**: True/False validation of predictions
- **Time saved**: Measure exact milliseconds/minutes saved by ML predictions
- **Stability improvement**: Track connection stability improvements
- **Cost optimization**: Cellular data cost reduction through smart monitoring

## UBUS API Requirements
- **Core ML Monitoring**: status, get_predictions, get_statistics, get_config
- **Multi-Interface Intelligence**: get_multi_interface_status, predict_interface_outage, update_mwan3_weights
- **Analytics & Visualization**: get_analytics_summary, get_interface_score_history, get_accuracy_trends
- **Enhanced Network Discovery**: interfaces_detailed with ML recommendations

## Resource Management
- **Memory efficient**: <4MB RAM usage
- **Storage efficient**: <10MB storage usage
- **Response time**: <100ms response time
- **Thread safety**: Proper mutex protection for concurrent access

## Testing and Validation
- **Production validation**: Test on actual RUTOS systems
- **Zero simulation**: All real system integration, no mock data
- **Comprehensive testing**: Full test suite for all ML phases
- **Performance monitoring**: Track ML system health and effectiveness